# Paid digital goods (ebook PDFs) live here.
#
# This directory is deliberately OUTSIDE ./uploads because /files/** is
# permitAll() in SecurityConfig — anything under uploads/ is downloadable by
# anyone who has the URL. Ebooks are paid products, so their bytes may only be
# streamed by an endpoint that first checks the buyer owns them.
#
# The files themselves are never committed: they are large (100 MB+) and are
# licensed content.
*
!.gitignore
